  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \n  \nThe ownership of |old_web_contents| will be passed to |source_page_handle|[1] after |SwapWebContents|. Then |source_page_handle| will move to |MaybeStartDistillation|[2] as a parameter. At this time, if the check fails, it will return immediately. |source_page_handle|"
